    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d805-a1">

                <pb facs="0953" n="859" xml:id="pg859"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No, 941.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Missionaries.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Are you properly guarded? Do you wish guards to continue? Telegraph or write all
                    your wants and dangers to me direct.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
